title: Presidential Election Candidates
subtitle: Who is going to run?
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 1
view-if: your_mother == "President of America"


= Presidential Election Candidates

Text, text, text, whatever - this could easily be such a long text, trvst.

- @kpd_maintains_agreement
- @kpd_says_fuck_you
- @bourgeois_set_up_1925

@kpd_maintains_agreement
title: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> will support a candidate of the United Left
view-if: kpd_unity_support == 1 and kpd_relation >= 45
go-to: bourgeois_set_up_1925

@kpd_says_fuck_you
title: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> withdraws support for united action with us.
view-if: kpd_unity_support == 1 and kpd_relation < 45
on-arrival: kpd_unity_support = 0
go-to: bourgeois_set_up_1925

Even though the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> has pledged support to a candidate uniting the worker's parties, our relations have suffered too much since the agreement was reached. Ernst Thälmann will run.

@bourgeois_set_up_1925
title: Who will the other parties run?
view-if: kpd_unity_support == 0

- @bourgeois_unity_in_1925
- @dpp_offer_1925
- @nothing_special_here


@dpp_offer_1925
view-if: ddp_relation >= 35 and bourgeois_united_front < 11
title: The <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> proposes a united WEIMAR candidate.
subtitle: They think we should focus the republican vote in one candidate from the start.
on-arrival: bourgeois_unity_candidate = 0

The <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> proposes the independent politician Walter Simons as a candidate for the Weimar Coalition. They have previously tried to rally the bourgeois parties behind him which didn't get much attention from other parties.

- @wow_literally_soooo_cool
- @the_ddp_was_so_dumb_really


@wow_literally_soooo_cool
title: We will support Simons.
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">**Centrists**</span> prefer running their own candidate. This decision is unpopular within our party.
on-arrival: spd_support_simons = 1
choose-if: ledebour_unity_candidate == 0 and rosenfeld_unity_candidate == 0
unavailable-subtitle: We have commited ourselves to running for the working class.
go-to: view_candidate_runs

@the_ddp_was_so_dumb_really
title: We won't support Simons.
go-to: view_candidate_runs


@nothing_special_here
title: The bourgeois are likely to hold fragmented campaigns.
view-if: bourgeois_united_front < 11 and ddp_relation < 35
on-arrival: bourgeois_unity_candidate = 0
go-to: view_candidate_runs

With the presidential office up for grabs most bourgeois parties want to throw their hat into the race and try their luck.

@bourgeois_unity_in_1925
title: The bourgeois put up a united front to keep us out of power.
view-if: bourgeois_united_front >= 11
on-arrival: bourgeois_unity_candidate = 1
go-to: view_candidate_runs

- @view_candidate_runs: View the running candidates.

@view_candidate_runs
on-arrival: {!

if (Q.bourgeois_unity_candidate == 0) {
if (Q.freiberg_bloodbath_seen == 1 && Q.dnvp_votes < 25) Q.jarres_run_1925 = 1;
if (Q.dnvp_votes >= 25) Q.westrap_run_1925 = 1;
if (!Q.jarres_run_1925 && !Q.westrap_run_1925) Q.heinze_run_1925 = 1;

if (Q.chancellor != "Marx") Q.marx_run_1925 = 1;
if (!Q.marx_run_1925 && Q.workers_z >= 12) Q.stegerwald_run_1925 = 1;
if (!Q.marx_run_1925 && Q.workers_z < 12) Q.hermes_run_1925 = 1;

if (Q.spd_support_simons == 1) Q.simons_run_1925;
if (!Q.simons_run_1925 && Q.france_relation >= 70) Q.gessler_run_1925 = 1;
if (!Q.simons_run_1925 && Q.france_relation < 70) Q.hellpach_run_1925 = 1;
}

if (Q.bourgeois_unity_candidate == 1) {
if (Q.bourgeois_unity >= 16 && Q.bourgeois_unity < 20 && Q.z_relation < 30 && Q.pro_repulic >= 65 && Q.chancellor == "Luther") Q.marx_run_1925 = 1;
if (Q.bourgeois_unity >= 20 && Q.z_relation < 30 && Q.pro_repulic >= 65 && Q.chancellor == "Luther") Q.simons_run_1925 = 1;
if (Q.chancellor != "Luther") Q.luther_run_1925 = 1;
if (Q.freiberg_bloodbath_seen == 1 && !Q.luther_run_1925 && !Q.simons_run_1925 && !Q.luther_run_1925) Q.jarres_run_1925 = 1;
if (!Q.jarres_run_1925) Q.kardorff_run_1925 = 1;
}

if (Q.nsdap_leader == "Strasser" && Q.bourgeois_unity_candidate == 1) Q.strasser_run_1925 = 1;
if (Q.nsdap_leader == "Strasser" && Q.bourgeois_unity_candidate == 1) Q.ludendorff_run_1925 = 1;
if (Q.bourgeois_unity_candidate == 0) Q.ludendorff_run_1925 = 1;

!}

- @reichsblock: What about the right?
- @bourgeois: What about the bourgeois?



@reichsblock
view-if: bourgeois_unity_candidate == 0


- @jarres_run: The Reichsblock will run Karl Jarres
- @westrap_run: The Reichsblock will run Kuno von Westrap
- @heinze_run: The Reichsblock will run Rudolf Heinze

@jarres_run
view-if: jarres_run_1925
on-arrival: reichsblock_prescan = "Karl Jarres"
face-image: img/portraits/jarres.jpg
go-to: center

