[? if scheidemann_in == "SPD":
<div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em;"> <img src="img/portraits/ScheidemannPhilipp.jpg" style="width: 100%; max-width: 190px;"/>  <div>Scheidemann used to be both party leader and then Chancellor, in 1919 he even ran against Ebert for the presidential office. His politics are perfectly aligned with those of the centrist faction arguing for cooperation with the DVP when necessary but maintaining the principles of Marx.<br/> Faction: Center </div> </div> ?]

